  {
   "section": "intro",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "eyebrow",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "Ritual, meet intelligence"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "Barista craft,"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 2,
     "text": "with a mind of its own."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 3,
     "text": "For a hundred mornings, the Atelier watches how you like your cup, then makes it that way without being asked. No apps to fuss over, no settings to memorise. Just coffee that feels like it knows you, because, cup by cup, it has come to."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 4,
     "text": "See how it learns →",
     "href": "#learn"
    }
   ],
   "imgCount": 0,
   "editableTexts": 3,
   "repeats": []
  },
  {
   "section": "learn",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "eyebrow",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "How it learns you"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "Your taste, drawn one cup at a time."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 2,
     "text": "Every cup teaches the Atelier a little more: how strong, how sweet, how you like your mornings to feel. We call the picture it builds your flavour DNA. Watch it shift as the day, and your mood, changes."
    },
    {
     "role": "eyebrow",
     "order": 3,
     "text": "Remembered"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 4,
     "text": "It keeps what you love, and quietly lets go of what you don't."
    },
    {
     "role": "eyebrow",
     "order": 5,
     "text": "Adaptive"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 6,
     "text": "Bolder before a long day, gentler when there is time to linger."
    },
    {
     "role": "eyebrow",
     "order": 7,
     "text": "Yours everywhere"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 8,
     "text": "Your profile travels with you, so any Atelier pours it just right."
    },
    {
     "role": "eyebrow",
     "order": 9,
     "text": "Strength"
    },
    {
