  {
   "section": "voices",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "eyebrow",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "From kitchens like yours"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "“It worked out that my Monday needs more than my Sunday. I never taught it that. It simply ”"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 2,
     "text": "knew."
    },
    {
     "role": "eyebrow",
     "order": 3,
     "text": "Mara · Lisbon"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 4,
     "text": "“The first machine I've owned that feels less like a gadget and more like a habit.”"
    },
    {
     "role": "eyebrow",
     "order": 5,
     "text": "Devon · Melbourne"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 6,
     "text": "“I haven't run out of beans since it arrived. A small thing that quietly changed my week.”"
    },
    {
     "role": "eyebrow",
     "order": 7,
     "text": "Priya · Bristol"
    }
